====================================================================
MECHANICAL LOGIC
====================================================================

For mechanical assets, model relationships rather than isolated
visual decorations.

Example:

BODY
→ MOUNT
→ AXLE
→ SUSPENSION
→ WHEEL

or:

HULL
→ TURRET RING
→ TURRET
→ MANTLET
→ GUN

or any equivalent hierarchy appropriate to the object.

Moving parts should have believable pivots.

Parts should not float without purpose.

However:

independent bolts
independent cables
independent brackets
track shoes
grousers
mechanical modules
service panels

are legitimate independent objects when appropriate.

Do not falsely merge everything into one mesh.

